                                                "sense_id": "5aebf6a4-fd7a-3fae-a520-dc53767c421c",
                                                "text": "Soils are a prominent feature of floodplain environments, and we include them in this section because most of the available information on ancient soils pertains to alluvial examples, aside from those in Quaternary-Recent time."
